  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_00041.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px\" /></p>\n<p>La sede del Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil de Onda ha acogido la noche de este jueves la pen&uacute;ltima entrega del a&ntilde;o del ciclo Cine y cena, con la proyeccin de la pelicula El Guateque, protagonizada por Peter Sellers y Claudine Longet.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicinemaelguatequeateneu/dsc_0001.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0001\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicinemaelguatequeateneu/dsc_0002.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicinemaelguatequeateneu/dsc_0003.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicinemaelguatequeateneu/dsc_0004.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparicinemaelguatequeateneu/dsc_0005.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
